message.content:
{
 "action": "film_Alma",
 "words": "Alma, step into the light. We have one take.",
 "intention": "Capture the projectionist's voice before the theater closes, ensuring her daughter in Pittsburgh can hear the final message from the Rialto.","detail": "The festival lights are pretty, but they are temporary. Alma’s voice is the only thing that will travel on that regional line. I will frame her face against the dark of the empty auditorium, ensuring the microphone picks up the tremor in her voice when she says 'I know that voice.' It is the only recording that matters."}
